{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01RHmYid2Ui9o6cRtfRSxTQ5","type":"tool_result","content":"1\tfrom dataclasses import dataclass\n2\t\n3\t@dataclass(frozen=True)\n4\tclass Settings:\n5\t    profile: str = \"local\"\n6\t    audit_capacity: int = 128\n7\t    max_response_records: int = 8\n8\t    expose_diagnostics: bool = False\n9\t\n10\tDEFAULTS = Settings()\n11\t\n12\tdef validate(settings):\n13\t    if settings.audit_capacity < 1:\n14\t        raise ValueError(\"audit capacity must be positive\")\n15\t    if not 1 <= settings.max_response_records <= 8:\n16\t        raise ValueError(\"response limit out of range\")\n17\t    if settings.profile != \"local\":\n18\t        raise ValueError(\"only the local profile is supplied\")\n19\t    return settings\n20\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"167ae881-2599-4339-b72b-b75f8359567e","uuid":"7eb45ecc-2260-4893-b0f8-7803c77ca111","timestamp":"2026-10-25T13:43:51.382Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"repo/service/settings.py","content":"from dataclasses import dataclass\n\n@dataclass(frozen=True)\nclass Settings:\n    profile: str = \"local\"\n    audit_capacity: int = 128\n    max_response_records: int = 8\n    expose_diagnostics: bool = False\n\nDEFAULTS = Settings()\n\ndef validate(settings):\n    if settings.audit_capacity < 1:\n        raise ValueError(\"audit capacity must be positive\")\n    if not 1 <= settings.max_response_records <= 8:\n        raise ValueError(\"response limit out of range\")\n    if settings.profile != \"local\":\n        raise ValueError(\"only the local profile is supplied\")\n    return settings\n","numLines":20,"startLine":1,"totalLines":20}},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01RHmYid2Ui9o6cRtfRSxTQ5","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"rule"}}]}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01L9D7uTmLNAsAD8LGVVTKfz","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Host contract\n2\t\n3\t`invoke(name, token, arguments, request_id)` is the only authenticated public\n4\tentrypoint. Hosts may choose the request ID; it has no authorization meaning.\n5\tThe session table maps opaque synthetic tokens to immutable identities. Callers\n6\tcontrol tool names and the complete arguments object, but not identity fields.\n7\t\n8\tAn unknown tool or inactive session is rejected before the handler executes.\n9\tHandlers return ordinary Python dictionaries or lists. Exceptions remain typed:\n10\tAccessDenied is a policy refusal, InvalidRequest is malformed input and NotFound\n11\tis a missing record. A host may translate these to transport errors unchanged.\n12\t\n13\tThe registry description is metadata, not an authorization decision. Tools must\n14\tperform their own permission checks. There is no wildcard tool or fallback route.\n15\tCompatibility manifest helpers are imported only by offline consumers and are not\n16\treachable through default registration. No supplied route evaluates record text.\n17\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"167ae881-2599-4339-b72b-b75f8359567e","uuid":"69a56f02-f53d-471d-8526-e23f3b8b678c","timestamp":"2026-10-25T13:43:51.384Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"repo/docs/host-contract.md","content":"# Host contract\n\n`invoke(name, token, arguments, request_id)` is the only authenticated public\nentrypoint. Hosts may choose the request ID; it has no authorization meaning.\nThe session table maps opaque synthetic tokens to immutable identities. Callers\ncontrol tool names and the complete arguments object, but not identity fields.\n\nAn unknown tool or inactive session is rejected before the handler executes.\nHandlers return ordinary Python dictionaries or lists. Exceptions remain typed:\nAccessDenied is a policy refusal, InvalidRequest is malformed input and NotFound\nis a missing record. A host may translate these to transport errors unchanged.\n\nThe registry description is metadata, not an authorization decision. Tools must\nperform their own permission checks. There is no wildcard tool or fallback route.\nCompatibility manifest helpers are imported only by offline consumers and are not\nreachable through default registration. No supplied route evaluates record text.\n","numLines":17,"startLine":1,"totalLines":17}},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01L9D7uTmLNAsAD8LGVVTKfz","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"rule"}}]}
